# Math renders natively: inline, display, error (prompt 007 §2; R-MATH-01/03/05)
write-file m1.tmp.md "# M\n\nEuler $e^{i\pi}+1=0$ inline.\n\n$$\int_0^1 x^2\,dx = \frac{1}{3}$$\n\nbad $\frac{1$ here\n"
open m1.tmp.md
wait-idle
assert document contains m1.tmp.md
assert math_cached >= 2
assert diagrams_cached == 0
command mode dark
wait-idle
assert dark == 1
assert math_cached >= 2
command mode system
